  "description": "Faster. Further. Funner.\n\nWhere power meets performance.\n\nBonneville is designed for seasoned riders looking for the perfect training tool as much as it is for enthusiasts who live for the joy of road riding and the thrill of pedal-assist to go faster, further, and have more fun.\n\nYou can’t even tell it’s an e-bike.\n\nThe horizontal battery sits inside the frame for a sleek look and balanced weight. The Fazua Ride 60 is concealed in the bottom bracket, quiet, and powerful enough to assist up to 28 mph—without giving up analog road-bike feel.\n\nAmple tire clearance\n\n45mm tire clearance lets Bonneville adapt from smooth pavement to roads dusted with gravel. 180mm rotors and dropper-post compatibility keep stopping and handling confident wherever the road takes you.\n\nRange that matches the day\n\nThe long-lasting 430Wh battery lets you ride favorite routes without range anxiety. Adjust assist to match training goals—or switch it off and Bonneville still rides like a high-end road bike.",
